# a111.script -- objc_edit caret on the desktop's "New folder" dialog (an editable FTEXT field under form_do).
# 200 Hz ticks after "[desk] desktop up". Pointer parked bottom-right first (clear of the dialog).
# Alt+C opens C:, Ctrl+N opens "New folder"; then A, B, Left, Left, Right, Backspace -- the same
# key sequence as method/hatari-newfolder.sh on Hatari Falcon EmuTOS. Steps are 600 ticks (3 s) apart;
# run.py takes each screendump 1.5 s after the step's feed line, i.e. mid-way between two steps.
200 0xF8 0x7F 0x7F 0xF8 0x7F 0x7F 0xF8 0x7F 0x7F 0xF8 0x7F 0x7F
300 0x38 0x2E 0xAE 0xB8
900 0x1D 0x31 0xB1 0x9D
1500 0x1E 0x9E
2100 0x30 0xB0
2700 0x4B 0xCB
3300 0x4B 0xCB
3900 0x4D 0xCD
4500 0x0E 0x8E
5100 0xF8 0x00 0x00
